    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1918\"><em data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1918\">(6th Level)</em></p><p data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"1969\">You bank one prepared manifestation as a sigiled casting.</p><p data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2000\">After deliberate preparation:</p><ul data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2154\"><li data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2056\"><p data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2056\">Store one prepared manifestation as an inscribed annotation.</p></li><li data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2154\"><p data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2154\">Later, cast it quickly without losing the prepared slot until the stored version is discharged.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2184\">This does not remove misfire risk.</p><p data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2211\">It front-loads stability.</p><p data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2261\">You prepared yesterday so you can survive today.</p><p data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2300\"></p><p><em>Recosted 2026-08-23: this ability's earlier economy (Civic Charge / Strain / Resonance / Leverage / Administrative Pressure) is retired \u2014 everything now runs on Surge, Clarity, Noise, and the misfire ladder. The ability dialog's cost line is the truth; ledgers named here are narrative, GM-adjudicated, never a tracked pool.</em></p>",
